# Keep secrets, local state and build output out of the image build context.
.git
.github
.claude
**/node_modules
**/dist
apps/api/src/generated
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/*.local.json
**/.mail-sink
**/.storage
e2e/.auth
test-results
playwright-report
docs/milestones/*-screenshots
*.log
# Security audit F12: local backups, demo and restore copies and crash dumps may hold real data.
backups
**/backups
**/.demo-storage
**/.restore-storage
*.stackdump
**/*.dump
**/*.sql.gz
